      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CATCHING (8) chased the lead early from the inside and boxed on well to finish second, beaten one length (19.93) at this track in a Grade 6 over 350m. Leading chance again. CRYSTAL CROWN (5) is a fast dog well performed over the sprint races. Was a bit beyond her last time when sixth (31.08) over 530m at Angle Park in a Grade 6 but is better suited here over less ground. Goes very well here at the trip finding the frame in each of three starts. Has ability and can measure up. SIR RICO (2) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten 3.5 lengths into third (20.09) at this track in a Grade 6 over 350m. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Leading player again. QUEEN FLOW (7) is a last start winner worth following up.",
